---
import DashboardCard from "./dashboard/DashboardCard.astro";
---
<DashboardCard>
  <h2 class="card-title">ESPHome &amp; Shelly</h2>
  <p class="card-subtitle mb-4">
    Push readings from off-the-shelf LAN sensors without writing custom firmware.
  </p>
  <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 mb-4">
    <li>
      Create a <strong>push device</strong> under
      <a class="text-link" href="/dashboard/devices">Devices</a>
      and copy the ingest URL.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/esphome-shelly-recipes">ESPHome &amp; Shelly recipes</a>
      HTTP POST examples for temperature, humidity, and door contacts.
    </li>
    <li>
      Pair a door sensor with a freeze rule:
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/garage-door-cold-playbook">door + cold playbook</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="text-link" href="/esphome/thermaltrace.yaml" download>Download ESPHome snippet</a>
      copy into your device YAML after setting <code>thermaltrace_ingest_url</code> in secrets.
    </li>
    <li>
      Already on Home Assistant? Use the
      <a class="text-link" href="/integrations/home-assistant">HACS integration</a>
      or <a class="text-link" href="/about/adding-devices">MQTT bridge</a> instead.
    </li>
  </ul>
</DashboardCard>
